# Not a LaTeX repository — zero .tex, zero LaTeX byproducts (measured 2026-09-20).
# The generic template's byproduct list is deliberately absent. See LAYOUT.md.

# Standing ruling: PDFs are never tracked, anywhere, whatever produced them.
*.pdf

# Magma compiled signatures — regenerated on attach (LAYOUT.md TS6)
*.sig

# NOTE: *.out is deliberately NOT ignored. test-valuations/*.out are tracked
# expected-output fixtures (LAYOUT.md TS4). Ignoring them untracks the fixtures.

